        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Analog</i> is game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKIN OFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skin off</i> is the first game in <i>Analog,</i> where you play as a teenager during summer break. You decide to stay at your uncle's house away from the city with your friends. A strange message, however, appears on the TV that changes your plans. <strong>Follow the instruction</strong> if you want to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>VHS like visuals</strong> and <strong>creepy atmosphere </strong><i>Skin off</i> fully immerses you to its nostalgic <strong>90's aesthetic</strong>, so you can experience analog horror in the appropriate environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Analog</i> is game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKIN OFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skin off</i> is the first game in <i>Analog,</i> where you play as a teenager during summer break. You decide to stay at your uncle's house away from the city with your friends. A strange message, however, appears on the TV that changes your plans. <strong>Follow the instruction</strong> if you want to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>VHS like visuals</strong> and <strong>creepy atmosphere </strong><i>Skin off</i> fully immerses you to its nostalgic <strong>90's aesthetic</strong>, so you can experience analog horror in the appropriate environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Skin Off is an analog horror game where you play as a teenager spending a summer night alone at your uncle’s house. As you wait for your friends to arrive the next day, a strange message is broadcasted on national television, signaling the start of a nightmare you can’t escape.",
